    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45957" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχιδν-α</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχις</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>viper</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.108
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				771
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				218a
			</span></i>, etc.; prob. of a <i>constrictor snake,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				28.3
			</span></i>: metaph., of a treacherous wife or friend, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				249
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				531
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱματισμένη ἔ.</span>, of
			woman, <i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γεννήματα ἐχιδνῶν</span> brood
				<i>of vipers</i>, term of reproach, in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				3.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pr. n. of a
			monster, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				297
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1099
			</span></i>.</div>
